    "body": "Just ran into the exact same error when working with flow past obstacle. In my case there are also batch and channel dimensions. I format the torch tensors as [batch=4, channel=2, W=64, H=64], but get the following error:\n`RuntimeError: Function TorchCustomFunctionBackward returned an invalid gradient at index 1 - got [4, 64, 2, 64] but expected shape compatible with [4, 64, 64, 2]`\nI managed to trace the error down to make_incompressible - without it the error disappears. However I could not find any explanation to why this is the case, or how could this be resolved...\nAny workaround or insight to the issue would be greatly appreciated. ",
