    "body": "Had the very strange phenomenon that at first it seemed that updating to 3.4 (from 3.3) fixed the issue, both in my case and in the code above. However, a few days later, trying to run OP's code resulted in error once again, `RuntimeError: Function TorchCustomFunctionBackward returned an invalid gradient at index 1 - got [32, 2, 64] but expected shape compatible with [2, 64, 32]`.\nMultiple attempts using both versions of PhiFlow and different devices and environments could not get it to run properly as it did for that moment, so I am thoroughly confused.",
