    "updated_at": "2025-09-10T22:54:20Z",
    "body": "I've tracked this to a problem in Φ-ML where custom gradients weren't properly transposed. [This commit](https://github.com/tum-pbs/PhiML/commit/96ef3e4d8376502a1b75dcdd799d9ada1cb39f72) should fix it.\n\nTo test it, run\n```\npip uninstall phiml\npip install git+https://github.com/tum-pbs/PhiML@develop\n```",
    "author_association": "COLLABORATOR",
    "pin": null,
